---
import Wrapper from '../layouts/wrapper.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';

import heroImage from '../assets/images/chrome/me-seated.png'

const breadcrumb = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/', previous: true },
  { label: 'About Me' },
];

---

<Wrapper
	title="Bio"
	description="Nick Clarkson—creative technologist, digital strategist, and agency leader—combining technical expertise with a user-centred approach to build meaningful digital work."
	image="/src/assets/images/finland.jpg">

	<section class="section">
		<Hero
			backgroundImage={heroImage}
			breadcrumb={breadcrumb}
			title="Who am I?"
		/>
	</section>
	

	
	<section class="section typography measure">
		<h2>Blending experience, empathy and curiosity to build better digital experiences.</h2>										

		<p>With over 25 years in web development and more than 15 leading technical teams, I’ve delivered high-impact digital work across agency and in-house settings—from large-scale hospitality platforms to integrated CRM ecosystems. I care deeply about clean, maintainable code, purposeful design, and creating digital experiences that are ethical, inclusive, and resilient.</p>
		<p>I’m a pragmatic innovator: equally at home simplifying a solution or applying cutting-edge tools where they bring real value. My work spans frontend and backend development, API architecture, CRM strategy, ethical tracking, and AI-augmented workflows. If there’s a faster, smarter, or more elegant way to deliver, I’ll find it.</p>
		<p>Outside of work, I enjoy life with my blended family, keep fit by cycling, and stay creatively energised through <a href="https://nightofthevampire.com" target="_blank">electronic music production and DJing</a>, with releases on a number of indie labels.</p>

		<h3>Technical Deep Dive</h3>

		<h3>Frontend Development</h3>
		<p>I design and build fast, accessible frontends that deliver smooth, inclusive, and high-performing user experiences across all devices.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>HTML5</li>
			<li>CSS, SASS, BEM</li>
			<li>Javascript, TypeScript, Vue</li>
			<li>Sketch, Figma</li>
		</ul>

		<h3>Backend Development</h3>
		<p>I develop robust, scalable backends that are secure, reliable, and easy to maintain—designed for seamless integration and built with testing and long-term stability in mind.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>PHP, Node</li>
			<li>Laravel</li>
			<li>CraftCMS, Astro</li>						
		</ul>

		<h3>DevOps & PaaS</h3>
		<p>I manage deployment pipelines and infrastructure with a focus on simplicity, automation, and resilience—streamlining environments and workflows to keep projects efficient and production-ready.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Docker, DDev</li>
			<li>Heroku, Netlify, AWS, Azure</li>	
			<li>Git, Git Flow, SVN</li>										
		</ul>

		<h2>Executive Skills</h2>
	
		<h3>Team Management</h3>
		<p>I lead teams with a focus on clarity, collaboration, and growth—supporting developers through mentorship, structured workflows, and a shared commitment to quality.</p>		

		<h3>Project Management</h3>
		<p>I approach project management with a focus on clarity, momentum, and delivery—balancing scope, time, and budget while keeping teams aligned and clients confident throughout the process.</p>

		<h3>Technical Direction</h3>
		<p>I provide technical direction that balances innovation with pragmatism—aligning architecture, tooling, and delivery with project goals and long-term maintainability.</p>

		<h3>Digital Strategy</h3>
		<p>I shape digital strategies that connect user needs with business objectives—focusing on clarity, impact, and scalable, measurable outcomes.</p>

		<h3>Agency Leadership</h3>
		<p>I provide agency leadership at a board level by setting strategic direction, aligning creative and commercial goals, and ensuring the agency delivers work that is effective, sustainable, and true to its values.</p>		

		<h3>Business Development</h3>
		<p>I lead business development through strategic pitching and RFP responses—translating client needs into compelling proposals that align creative insight with commercial opportunity.</p>

		<h2>Testimonial</h2>
		<blockquote>
		<p>“Nick is the most knowledgeable and straight-talking Technical expert I've 
			ever met, and he's an absolute joy to work alongside. He's insightful, 
			strategic and creative, and makes even the driest of projects fun to work 
			on. I hope we get to work together again one day.”</p></blockquote>
		<p><strong>Lucy Stone</strong> - Head of Communications, Bath Spa University</p> 
	
	</section>			
</Wrapper>